From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Mon, 12 Oct 2026 09:03:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] 2909: the plan is told once, not first in a step
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Box 54162 (conv 50220): a step said „ელენესა და რატის ასისტენტებს
დავველაპარაკები და ვკითხავ…" two seconds before the plan message said the
same talks again. The existing one-copy rule caught only a step that also
ended on „დავიწყო?". Now, when the run's reply carries the plan's closing
question, a step that announces talking to people's assistants is dropped.
No new text. The row's other half (the plan says who but not what will be
asked) is the plan sentence's wording and stays with Misho.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01HwFREQwL5g9E6qRrUf9bau
---
 .../__tests__/thePlanIsToldOnce.test.ts       | 31 ++++++++++---------
 src/services/chat.service.ts                  | 17 ++++++++++
 2 files changed, 34 insertions(+), 14 deletions(-)

diff --git a/src/services/__tests__/thePlanIsToldOnce.test.ts b/src/services/__tests__/thePlanIsToldOnce.test.ts
index ed5db20..891142c 100644
--- a/src/services/__tests__/thePlanIsToldOnce.test.ts
+++ b/src/services/__tests__/thePlanIsToldOnce.test.ts
@@ -1,25 +1,28 @@
 import { readFileSync } from 'fs';
 import { join } from 'path';
-import { carriesPlanSentence } from '../planJustification';
+import { retellsThePlansTalks } from '../chat.service';
 
-/** 48247 (thread 46960): a plan step and then the final reply told the same plan twice. */
-describe('a plan told early as a step', () => {
-  it('is recognised by the plan sentence, in the tester’s words', () => {
+/** 2909 (box 54162, conv 50220): a step told the plan two seconds before the plan message. */
+describe('the plan is told once', () => {
+  it('knows a step that announces the plan’s talks', () => {
     expect(
-      carriesPlanSentence(
-        'ნიკოს, გიას, ლევანის და დავითის ასისტენტებს დაველაპარაკები და შევეცდები. დავიწყო?',
+      retellsThePlansTalks(
+        'ამასთან ერთად, ელენესა და რატის ასისტენტებს დავველაპარაკები და ვკითხავ, ხომ არ იცნობენ ბუღალტერს.',
       ),
     ).toBe(true);
-    expect(carriesPlanSentence('ვეძებ შენს ნაცნობებში.')).toBe(false);
+    expect(retellsThePlansTalks("I will talk to Elene's and Rati's assistants.")).toBe(true);
   });
 
-  it('is dropped once the reply carries the plan, right after the word-for-word tidy-up', () => {
+  it('leaves every other step alone', () => {
+    expect(retellsThePlansTalks('🔍 კონტაქტებში ვეძებ: „ბუღალტერი"…')).toBe(false);
+    expect(retellsThePlansTalks('ორი ბუღალტერი ვიპოვე შენს კონტაქტებში.')).toBe(false);
+  });
+
+  it('drops such steps only when this run’s reply is the plan with its question', () => {
     const chat = readFileSync(join(__dirname, '..', 'chat.service.ts'), 'utf8');
-    const repeats = chat.indexOf('await dropStepsTheReplyRepeats(threadId, runId, storedReply);');
-    const plans = chat.indexOf('await dropPlanStepsTheReplyCarries(threadId, runId, storedReply);');
-    expect(repeats).toBeGreaterThan(-1);
-    expect(plans).toBeGreaterThan(repeats);
-    const fn = chat.slice(chat.indexOf('async function dropPlanStepsTheReplyCarries('));
-    expect(fn.slice(0, 600)).toContain('if (!runId || !carriesPlanSentence(reply)) return;');
+    expect(chat).toContain(
+      '} else if (!buriedAnswer && finalText.includes(PLAN_CLOSING_QUESTION[runLang(runId)])) {',
